abstract: >-
  CV and portfolio of Rowan Brad Quni-Gudzinas, a systems researcher studying how autonomous AI systems behave,
  fail and can be audited and governed, building on twenty years of network and decision-system modeling for the
  U.S. Federal Highway Administration and AARP.
